        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/7dfa69cee1d7a72b7014df302dfdce2c.avif?t=1764689307\" width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmares are spilling into reality.</strong><br>Become a guardian of dreams, combine powerful allies and mystical relics, and repel the horrors pouring from the Nightmare Gates.<br>A tactical defense game blending <strong>auto-chess synergy</strong> and <strong>tower defense strategy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/8a3b6998ec709a26a907b8832d2d833a.poster.avif?t=1764689307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/8a3b6998ec709a26a907b8832d2d833a.webm?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/8a3b6998ec709a26a907b8832d2d833a.mp4?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Luna &amp; Sol: Nightmare Ward』</strong> is a strategic defense game that fuses the <strong>depth of auto-chess</strong> with the <strong>intensity of tower defense</strong>.<br>As a guardian of dreams, you must confront terrifying creatures born from trauma-fueled nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit allies with unique dream classes and professions, combine them to unleash powerful synergies, and build the ultimate defense.<br>Every run offers new combinations, powerful relics, and ever-growing challenges that test your wit and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/1abe15079c02b43bdb37f2a4718458af.poster.avif?t=1764689307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/1abe15079c02b43bdb37f2a4718458af.webm?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/1abe15079c02b43bdb37f2a4718458af.mp4?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Synergy System</strong><br>Combine dream types and job classes to unlock devastating effects and team bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Nightmare Gates</strong><br>Face nightmarish monsters and deadly bosses, each with distinct patterns and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 Relics</strong><br>Collect relics during battle to enhance your power. Mix and match to find unique playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Beyond Death</strong><br>Even in defeat, your guardian grows stronger. Embrace the challenge and rise again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreams don’t collapse easily—as long as you don’t give up.</strong><br><strong>Begin your fight to defend the gates of dreams today.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/7dfa69cee1d7a72b7014df302dfdce2c.avif?t=1764689307\" width=1560 height=852 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmares are spilling into reality.</strong><br>Become a guardian of dreams, combine powerful allies and mystical relics, and repel the horrors pouring from the Nightmare Gates.<br>A tactical defense game blending <strong>auto-chess synergy</strong> and <strong>tower defense strategy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/8a3b6998ec709a26a907b8832d2d833a.poster.avif?t=1764689307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/8a3b6998ec709a26a907b8832d2d833a.webm?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/8a3b6998ec709a26a907b8832d2d833a.mp4?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Luna &amp; Sol: Nightmare Ward』</strong> is a strategic defense game that fuses the <strong>depth of auto-chess</strong> with the <strong>intensity of tower defense</strong>.<br>As a guardian of dreams, you must confront terrifying creatures born from trauma-fueled nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit allies with unique dream classes and professions, combine them to unleash powerful synergies, and build the ultimate defense.<br>Every run offers new combinations, powerful relics, and ever-growing challenges that test your wit and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/1abe15079c02b43bdb37f2a4718458af.poster.avif?t=1764689307\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/1abe15079c02b43bdb37f2a4718458af.webm?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745850/extras/1abe15079c02b43bdb37f2a4718458af.mp4?t=1764689307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Synergy System</strong><br>Combine dream types and job classes to unlock devastating effects and team bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Nightmare Gates</strong><br>Face nightmarish monsters and deadly bosses, each with distinct patterns and tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 100 Relics</strong><br>Collect relics during battle to enhance your power. Mix and match to find unique playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Beyond Death</strong><br>Even in defeat, your guardian grows stronger. Embrace the challenge and rise again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreams don’t collapse easily—as long as you don’t give up.</strong><br><strong>Begin your fight to defend the gates of dreams today.</strong></p>",
